  "title": "Simulation Monitoring Automation",
  "summary": "Detect diverging and stalled simulations in real time, before they waste hours of compute. The Simulation Monitor automation runs alongside iterative solver jobs on Rescale, providing a live dashboard with residual plots, tabular data switching, and automated CSV exports without requiring an interactive workstation. It supports Ansys Fluent, STAR-CCM+, and CFX today, with a plugin-based framework designed for fast extension to additional solvers.",
